WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.145
Your next service starts long before the first plate.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.565
Start with your menu, type or paste dishes,

00:00:09.805 --> 00:00:13.585
upload photos, or use a website link you have permission to
import.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.005
Using your phone, scan the code to send menu photos straight to

00:00:20.005 --> 00:00:20.545
your workspace.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.385
Here, we'll read a photo.

00:00:26.185 --> 00:00:29.585
Check the extracted text, review ingredient quantities and
units,

00:00:29.905 --> 00:00:30.905
then approve your menu.

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:41.435
Need another supplier?

00:00:42.135 --> 00:00:43.415
Choose an ingredient and area,

00:00:43.775 --> 00:00:45.235
then search external websites.

00:00:45.975 --> 00:00:48.135
Review the listing before adding their details.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.055
Already have trusted contacts?

00:00:52.695 --> 00:00:53.395
Add them directly.

00:00:54.055 --> 00:00:56.295
Your restaurant supplier records stay private.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.925
Create one price request with quantities,

00:01:03.145 --> 00:01:05.505
delivery timing, and a deadline for replies.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:09.275
New suppliers can apply.

00:01:09.895 --> 00:01:12.935
Your team reviews each application and decides who can quote.

00:01:18.350 --> 00:01:20.485
They send their prices through a private link.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.055
Compare the full cost.

00:01:28.675 --> 00:01:31.795
Here, a lower price per kilo costs more after delivery.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:44.465
Choose one supplier for the whole request,

00:01:44.765 --> 00:01:46.505
or split the purchase by item.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.715
For this order, choose one supplier and save the purchasing
decision.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.325
When the order arrives, check the invoice.

00:02:00.305 --> 00:02:02.345
Record a complete delivery or flag delays,

00:02:02.345 --> 00:02:05.545
missing quantities, wrong items or poor quality.

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:13.115
Next time, open your history.

00:02:13.895 --> 00:02:15.435
Repeat the purchase as a new draft.

00:02:16.195 --> 00:02:18.095
Update the dates and review it before sending.

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:26.345
QuotePlate. Keep every purchase clear.
